05 container the cipherdoc api and cli into a docker imag w 03 reach it first mileston today the initi dockerfil is complet what s includ a work dockerfil that packag both the api and cli entri point into a singl imag sourc id src gdoc 06 docker packag initi dockerfil complet owner evan document key doc 2006 last updat 2026 06 16 t005 container the cipherdoc api and cli into a docker imag w 03 reach it first mileston today the initi dockerfil is complet next step befor this can be treat a releas readi the imag need a size review and a cve check neither ha run yet against this build\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9ea95aa8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-06-16-Docker-Release-Notes.md\", \"id\": \"ad9dfc8f80d70ef0\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.43598337442406654, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.2628585491772379, \"vector_similarity\": 0.8399413, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-06-16-Docker-Release-Notes.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9ea95aa8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-06-16-Docker-Release-Notes.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-06-16-Docker-Release-Notes.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 553, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:00:47\", \"token_count\": 230, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-MEET-11\\n\\n# Fireflies Transcript: Handshake Protocol Deep Dive\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-09-22\\n\\n**Participants**: Alice (PM), Bob (Backend), Charlie (Engine), Diana (QA), Evan (DevOps)\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\nDiana walked the high-latency handshake timeout. The team left handshake work blocked; no timeout-bump workaround. Path still depends on the encryption workstream.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-MEET-11\\n\\n# Fireflies Transcript: Handshake Protocol Deep Dive\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-09-22\\n\\n**Participants**: Alice (PM), Bob (Backend), Charlie (Engine), Diana (QA), Evan (DevOps)\\n\\n## Transcript\\n\\n**Diana**: Handshake triage — nominal latency was fine; Bob's earlier validation held up on the local network. On a simulated high-latency link the handshake never finishes. It times out.\\n\\n**Bob**: That matches what I expected once we left the happy path. The prototype assumed round trips stay quick. High latency breaks the exchange.\\n\\n**Charlie**: Is this an encryption cost problem? AES-256 on the wire path is in the dependency chain here.\\n\\n**Bob**: It's related. The handshake still has to complete under that load, and on a slow link it doesn't. I don't have a fix that keeps the current exchange as-is.\\n\\n**Evan**: Bumping timeouts just hides it. If the link is slow enough, we still fail.\\n\\n**Diana**: I'll leave the high-latency repro in place so we can re-check when encryption or the handshake design changes.\\n\\n**Alice**: Then we leave it. Handshake work stays blocked on timeouts under high latency. It depends on the encryption path, and we're not inventing a workaround in this meeting.\\n\\n**Bob**: Agreed — no timeout bump. We'll revisit when the crypto path moves.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src meet 11 firefli transcript handshak protocol deep dive date 2026 09 22 particip alic pm bob backend charli engin diana qa evan devop summari diana walk the high latenc handshak timeout the team left handshak work block no timeout bump workaround path still depend on the encrypt workstream sourc id src meet 11 firefli transcript handshak protocol deep dive date 2026 09 22 particip alic pm bob backend charli engin diana qa evan devop transcript diana handshak triag nomin latenc wa fine bob s earlier valid held up on the local network on a simul high latenc link the handshak never finish it time out bob that match what i expect onc we left the happi path the prototyp assum round trip stay quick high latenc break the exchang charli is this an encrypt cost problem ae 256 on the wire path is in the depend chain here bob it s relat the handshak still ha to complet under that load and on a slow link it doesn t i don t have a fix that keep the current exchang ais evan bump timeout just hide it if the link is slow enough we still fail diana i ll leav the high latenc repro in place so we can re check when encrypt or the handshak design chang alic then we leav it handshak work stay block on timeout under high latenc it depend on the encrypt path and we re not invent a workaround in this meet bob agre no timeout bump we ll revisit when the crypto path move\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e940b5088a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/fireflies/2026-09-22-Handshake-Protocol-Deep-Dive.md\", \"id\": \"edcdc1df7188b1a3\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.4165339564410198, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.32610371634431407, \"vector_similarity\": 0.62753785, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/fireflies/2026-09-22-Handshake-Protocol-Deep-Dive.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e940b5088a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/fireflies/2026-09-22-Handshake-Protocol-Deep-Dive.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/fireflies/2026-09-22-Handshake-Protocol-Deep-Dive.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1463, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:03:18\", \"token_count\": 417, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-15\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-15\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-15\\n\\n**Title**: Docker Packaging\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-11\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nContainerize CipherDoc's API and CLI into a Docker image (WS-03). The initial Dockerfile was completed on 2026-06-16, but Diana's size/CVE review reopened the task on 2026-06-25 after the built image measured 2.1GB. Evan is redesigning the build as multi-stage toward a ~450MB target, swapped the base image to Alpine, and removed unused OCR and runtime packages that were not needed at runtime. As of the 2026-08-12 size/CVE verification, the image still exceeds the ~450MB target and CVE verification remains outstanding. This ClickUp record was opened at task creation; the reopening and remediation steps above were tracked through engineering channels.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-15\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-15\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-15\\n\\n**Title**: Docker Packaging\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-11\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Image size reduced to the ~450MB target (not yet met).\\n\\n- CVE verification passes with no outstanding findings (not yet met).\\n\\n- Task stays Active (Reopened) until both size and CVE checks pass.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-15\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-15\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-15\\n\\n**Title**: Docker Packaging\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-11\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nContainerize CipherDoc's API and CLI into a Docker image (WS-03). The initial Dockerfile was completed on 2026-06-16, but Diana's size/CVE review reopened the task on 2026-06-25 after the built image measured 2.1GB. 