\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-17)\\n\\n## Status\\n\\nRoot cause has not been isolated as part of this reproduction pass; this note only establishes that the defect reproduces and under which display conditions.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 30 document high dpi coordin misalign repro owner charli document key doc 2030 last updat 2026 09 02 retrospect cover 2026 08 17 test log reproduct note for the high dpi coordin misalign report for ciph 46 first reproduc 2026 08 17 sourc id src gdoc 30 document high dpi coordin misalign repro owner charli document key doc 2030 last updat 2026 09 02 retrospect cover 2026 08 17 repro step 1 open a pdf on a display report a scale factor abov 10 test at 150 and 200 2 compar the redact preview overlay s report box coordin against the coordin the render librari report for the same region 3 at scale factor abov 10 the overlay box is offset from the actual text region with the offset grow a scale factor increas sourc id src gdoc 30 document high dpi coordin misalign repro owner charli document key doc 2030 last updat 2026 09 02 retrospect cover 2026 08 17 result the misalign reproduc consist at both test scale factor it doe not reproduc at 100 scale sourc id src gdoc 30 document high dpi coordin misalign repro owner charli document key doc 2030 last updat 2026 09 02 retrospect cover 2026 08 17 status root caus ha not been isol a part of this reproduct pas this note onli establish that the defect reproduc and under which display condit\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e99d1d8e8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes-Review.md\", \"id\": \"a55699b32432c8bc\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3750183415477937, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.25702428792541954, \"vector_similarity\": 0.6503378, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e99d1d8e8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes-Review.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 987, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:58\", \"token_count\": 453, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-22\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-22\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-22\\n\\n**Title**: CLI-API Parity Verification\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-09\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nVerify functional parity between the CLI and REST API (WS-02). A regex-flag parsing discrepancy was found and fixed, and parity was confirmed Completed on 2026-07-11, depending on the completed batch CLI (T003) and REST API (T004). On 2026-07-20 the parity confirmation was documented for the T011 release evidence pack.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-22\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-22\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-22\\n\\n**Title**: CLI-API Parity Verification\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-09\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- CLI/API parity confirmed against the completed CLI (T003) and API (T004).\\n\\n- Parity confirmation documented for the T011 release evidence pack.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-22\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-22\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-22\\n\\n**Title**: CLI-API Parity Verification\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-09\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nVerify functional parity between the CLI and REST API (WS-02). A regex-flag parsing discrepancy was found and fixed, and parity was confirmed Completed on 2026-07-11, depending on the completed batch CLI (T003) and REST API (T004). On 2026-07-20 the parity confirmation was documented for the T011 release evidence pack.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-22\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-22\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-22\\n\\n**Title**: CLI-API Parity Verification\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-07-09\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\\n- **2026-07-09**: Bob - Task Create (Open)\\n\\n - *Task opened to verify parity between the CLI and the REST API.*\\n\\n- **2026-07-20**: Bob - Document CLI-API parity confirmation for release pack (Completed)\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 22 sourc id src cu ciph 22 task id ciph 22 titl cli api pariti verif status complet assigne bob prioriti normal date creat 2026 07 09 descript verifi function pariti between the cli and rest api w 02 a regex flag pars discrep wa found and fix and pariti wa confirm complet on 2026 07 11 depend on the complet batch cli t003 and rest api t004 on 2026 07 20 the pariti confirm wa document for the t011 releas evid pack clickup task ciph 22 sourc id src cu ciph 22 task id ciph 22 titl cli api pariti verif status complet assigne bob prioriti normal date creat 2026 07 09 accept criterion cli api pariti confirm against the complet cli t003 and api t004 pariti confirm document for the t011 releas evid pack clickup task ciph 22 sourc id src cu ciph 22 task id ciph 22 titl cli api pariti verif status complet assigne bob prioriti normal date creat 2026 07 09 descript verifi function pariti between the cli and rest api w 02 a regex flag pars discrep wa found and fix and pariti wa confirm complet on 2026 07 11 depend on the complet batch cli t003 and rest api t004 on 2026 07 20 the pariti confirm wa document for